step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Find the Dwarven Ferryman. Either enter the tunnel and subsequent cave just south of the Polar Hunter area (fairy ring DKS) OR go to northern part of Keldagrim and use the Travel option on the Dwarven Boatman.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to the Dwarven Ferryman (not the Dwarven Boatman) and use the Ring of Charos(a) or use the Travel option to go across the river.</str>
